<A NAME="rom19484_63"></A>We may be unable to secure funds for future tenant or other capital improvements, which could adversely affect our ability to attract or replace tenants and your return on investment. </I></B></FONT></P>  <P
STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:-6px"><FONT SIZE="1">&nbsp;</FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">When tenants do not renew their leases or otherwise vacate their space, it
