<A NAME="rom19484_64"></A>Uninsured losses relating to real property may adversely affect your returns. </I></B></FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:-6px"><FONT SIZE="1">&nbsp;</FONT></P> <P
STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">Paladin Advisors will attempt to ensure that all of our properties are adequately insured to cover certain casualty losses; however, there are types of
