to the date in question, was the beneficial owner of ten percent or more of the voting power of the then outstanding voting shares of the corporation. </FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"><FONT SIZE="1">&nbsp;</FONT></P> <P
