<A NAME="rom19484_176"></A>Dealer Manager and Participating Broker-Dealer Compensation and Terms </B></FONT></P>  <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:-6px"><FONT SIZE="1">&nbsp;</FONT></P> <P
STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">Except as provided below, the dealer manager will receive selling commissions of 7.0% of the gross offering proceeds. The dealer manager will also receive
